WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.667
Paris, 1784. A claim meets a controlled question.

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:13.334
One apricot tree was treated. The boy waited apart.

00:00:13.334 --> 00:00:20.000
With eyes covered, he visited four other trees.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.667
At the fourth untreated tree, he collapsed.

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:33.334
A real reaction does not establish the supposed cause.

00:00:33.334 --> 00:00:40.000
An experience is not proof of an invisible fluid.
